{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","血毒之羽"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对目标敌人造成大量持续伤害，每次造成伤害时根据已损失生命值造成一定比例的额外伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","翼对目标敌人施加“血毒之羽”，持续10秒。“血毒之羽”持续期间，目标每秒受到翼60% + 8% ATK的基础伤害，并且附带目标当前已损失生命值5%的额外伤害。额外伤害最高不超过翼100% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":42,"end":47,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":39,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":89,"end":97,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","目标每秒受到的基础伤害提升至65% + 8% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","目标每秒受到的基础伤害提升至70% + 8% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","目标每秒受到的基础伤害提升至75% + 8% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","目标每秒受到的基础伤害提升至80% + 8% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","利爪穿刺"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对敌人造成少量伤害，同时使其受到持续伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","翼将手刺入敌人胸口，造成70% ATK的伤害，拔出时再次造成70% ATK的伤害并撕裂其伤口，使目标在后续5秒内每秒受到翼120% + 20% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":65,"end":71,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":30,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":61,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","刺击造成的伤害增加至75% ATK，后续每秒造成的的伤害增加至140% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","刺击造成的伤害增加至80% ATK，后续每秒造成的的伤害增加至160% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","刺击造成的伤害增加至85% ATK，后续每秒造成的的伤害增加至180% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","蚀命羽咒"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","记录敌人受到的持续伤害，累计值满时爆发造成高额伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","翼在战斗开始时会飞向敌方阵营并让全部敌人受到“蚀命羽咒”的影响，飞行过程中自身处于无敌状态。\n 受到“蚀命羽咒”影响的敌人护甲和魔抗降低20%，在受到持续伤害时会将伤害记录为诅咒值。每当诅咒值累计达到其最大生命值20%时或者翼初始攻击力的400%时，诅咒爆发，对该敌人造成其最大生命值25% + 4%的伤害，爆发造成的伤害最高不会超过翼600% + 90% ATK。每名敌人诅咒爆发每3秒最多触发一次。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":145,"end":150,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":172,"end":178,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":41,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"},{"start":75,"end":79,"tooltip_key":"keyword:dotDmg"},{"start":168,"end":182,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","诅咒爆发时，造成的最大生命值的伤害提升至30% + 4%，伤害最高不会超过翼700% + 90% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":42,"end":48,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","诅咒爆发时，造成的最大生命值的伤害提升至35% + 4%，伤害最高不会超过翼800% + 90% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":42,"end":48,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","诅咒爆发时，造成的最大生命值的伤害提升至40% + 4%，伤害最高不会超过翼900% + 90% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":42,"end":48,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升12%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升16%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升20%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","羽咒灵祭"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","“蚀命羽咒”每次爆发时和携带“血毒之羽”的敌人被击败时回复能量，并使自身获得永久增伤。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“蚀命羽咒”每次爆发时翼回复100能量，同时使自身造成的伤害永久提高6%，最多提高至36%。\n敌人被击败时若携带“血毒之羽”，则翼会将其回收，“血毒之羽”每剩余1秒持续时间，便使翼回复50能量。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“蚀命羽咒”每次爆发时自身造成伤害提升的最高值提升至42%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“蚀命羽咒”爆发时造成伤害的85%转为真实伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“蚀命羽咒”每次爆发时自身造成伤害提升的最高值提升至48%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，扣除身前队友的生命值，使自身获得护盾和属性加成。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，翼夺取自己面前格队友的生命力，扣除其10%当前生命值，使翼获得30%攻击力加成以及30生命汲取，同时获得扣取生命值500%的护盾，最高不超过自身攻击力500%，持续到战斗结束。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","骨刺短匕"]]}